.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "fit_tree" "fit_tree"
.SH NAME
fit_tree \- Train the gradient boosting tree models of each target gene.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIfit_tree(\fBtree\fR as <generic> XGBoostGRN, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Train the gradient boosting tree models of each target gene.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBtree\fB \fR\- the untrained [XGBoostGRN](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.XGBoostGRN) model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the [TrainingReport](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.TrainingReport) object: the R²/RMSE of each gene model, the
 comparison against the mean baseline and the split importance of each
 regulator; an R# error message object is returned when the training fails.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
the training is parallel over the target genes, the training progress is
 written to the console when the \fBverbose\fR option of the configuration is on.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneTree
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
